From be02235baf9fe7948a7090898a217d478748e9bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: voice-naturalness <dev@local>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 23:39:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Natural-voice overhaul: fix robotic/beeping TTS in formant
 engine and neural speech path
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Why voices sounded robotic:
- formant engine drove a perfectly periodic PeriodicWave oscillator (the
  'mechanical beep'), stepped formants between phones, used linear
  trapezoid envelopes (audible clicks), constant-Q resonators, a flat
  45 ms metronomic word gap and near-monotone pitch.
- neural/system path fed fixed 180-char chunks back-to-back with no
  breathing pauses, sent raw markdown/symbols, fell back to robotic
  SAPI/espeak defaults and had no Chrome stall workaround.

Formant engine (AuraVoice) v2:
- continuous per-sentence glottal source rendered sample-by-sample
  (Rosenberg-style pulses) with cycle-to-cycle jitter, shimmer, vibrato
  and F0 drift; all voiced phones sliced from one phase-continuous buffer
- coarticulated 4-formant bank with bandwidth-derived Q and smoothstep
  frequency curves between adjacent phones
- natural prosody: declination, question rise, accent gestures, stress
  and phrase-final lengthening, seeded ±8% duration jitter, randomized
  word gaps and 130-300 ms sentence breathing pauses
- raised-cosine click-free envelopes, shaped stop bursts with aspiration
  (VOT), AM-modulated frication, true nasal murmur, whisper excitation
- master bus: spectral-tilt shelf + soft-clip limiter
- per-sentence segmentation so every sentence gets its own contour
- fix currency reading (.50 -> 'three dollars fifty cents')

Neural/system engines:
- sentence-aligned paragraph-aware chunking with clause-preferred splits
- natural breathing pauses between chunks (longer at paragraph breaks)
- prepareTextForNeuralSpeech(): strips markdown debris, converts
  dashes/symbols to spoken pauses, drops emoji, keeps paragraph beats
- scoreVoice()/pickBestVoice(): prefer neural/natural voices, penalize
  espeak/pico/flite-class robotic engines; auto-pick when unconfigured
- Chrome long-utterance stall keep-alive
- public API unchanged; all views keep working without edits

Adds tests/voice-smoke.mts: DSP verification (F0 accuracy, jitter and
shimmer presence, envelope/curve validity) and text-pipeline checks.

Verified: tsc --noEmit clean, eslint clean, next build succeeds,
engine suite 44/44, voice smoke suite 24/24.
